invalid type: string "llowing materials may be added to the vermicompost: \nManure, paper and unpainted cardboard, fruits and vegetables, eggshell, pruning, grass \nclippings, straw, crop waste, coffee pulp, cereal grains. Biosolids from home waste water \ntreatment plants (Lotzof 2012) may also be applied. \nVermicompost harvest\ncomposting©FAO/Pilar Roman\n34 354. Practical foundations of \n.\n